# BLACKOUT: RESTORE THE GRID — BACKEND ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION (EXAMPLE)
# Sphinx @ MNIT Jaipur
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to .env and substitute with actual secrets.
# NEVER commit the actual .env file to Git.
